  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報372期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春天有軟軟ê日頭，mā有雨水kā土地沃tâm，就親像lán少年時，有種種遭遇。〈17歲ê酸甘甜〉滋味啥款？Tī心內想意中人，是鬱卒iah幸福？〈大格雞慢啼〉教lán tī時為前途拍拚to bē慢。〈阿明kah紅龜粿ê相逢〉、〈台語伴——廣播劇公演記事〉hōo lán看著少年家ê想像力kah表演ê才華。M̄-koh人生到後一个坎站，有tang時仔lán ē〈忝〉、〈人艱苦〉，想beh知影〈是按怎壓力siunn大ē hōo人生白頭毛？〉。〈白頭鬃〉tsiânn做lán年歲有khah-ke ê痕跡，lán kám ē-tàng接受？來讀〈渡假中心——病院筆記〉，tsia有拄出世ê紅嬰仔，mā有身體虛lám ê序大人，每一幕lóng可比人生走馬燈，hōo人思考性命ê無常kah意義。</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgBGfnTab6v5Kky-99G10F4vSgDNXEheKJSuGmbF10VAqvKb49Kn0Dm_rx4foqaVzw5VbioYvQ7tugRZEcSw58s6y6h9nImVrDdK9nJpZ0Mxrwpuy4IpAxrVBHP2XT-6RF3x0EX7NuY3LISCe_TCGIjmMahyVpDyuBabeFx-2DaquOGhx0nOydsNv0NZ1Bj/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1372%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgBGfnTab6v5Kky-99G10F4vSgDNXEheKJSuGmbF10VAqvKb49Kn0Dm_rx4foqaVzw5VbioYvQ7tugRZEcSw58s6y6h9nImVrDdK9nJpZ0Mxrwpuy4IpAxrVBHP2XT-6RF3x0EX7NuY3LISCe_TCGIjmMahyVpDyuBabeFx-2DaquOGhx0nOydsNv0NZ1Bj/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1372%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv7shiEFWTCy9-wJIrUfe2CSgce8igCpw_wTlmDlLw2Ta2bQbmvtjau5Z6E